# Vercel deploys ONLY the precompiled build (index.html) + the serverless function in api/.
# Everything else in the repo — source, tests, build scripts, docs, data catalogs,
# Supabase-as-code — is developer material and must not reach the deploy surface.
#
# DO NOT ignore api/ — api/extract.js is the server-side Anthropic proxy that keeps
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY off the client. Ignoring it would silently break intake extraction.
